     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Dear Karl</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">What interpretation would be drawn when a warning message &quot;didn&#39;t converge&quot;. So for so many questions but am trying to teach my self with real data. <br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/attach/c6510f63578b5/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"540\" height=\"447\"><br></div></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:Vivaldi\"><br></span></span></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:Vivaldi\">Kind Regards</span></span></font></div><font size=\"2\"></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><div></div>\r\n<div><span><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span></font></span><b>Julius Pyton Sserumaga</b>, PhD.<br></div><div>Senior Research Scientist<br></div>\r\n<div><span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>National Agricultural Research Organization</b> (NARO)</span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"color:rgb(0